  "full-article-text": "<p id=\"\">From its genesis, the <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-are-the-radix-public-network-and-radix-ledger\"><strong id=\"\">Radix Public Network</strong></a> is, and always will be, <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-do-trustless-and-permissionless-mean\"><strong id=\"\">permissionless</strong></a>. The <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-are-the-main-radix-legal-entities\"><strong id=\"\">Radix Foundation</strong></a> (or any other <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-are-the-main-radix-legal-entities\"><strong id=\"\">Radix entity</strong></a><strong id=\"\">)</strong> will never, at any time, have any ability to apply permissions to <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-is-a-validator-node-2\"><strong id=\"\">validators</strong></a><strong id=\"\">,</strong> the <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-are-the-radix-public-network-and-radix-ledger\"><strong id=\"\">Radix Ledger</strong></a>, or network.<br></p><p id=\"\">As a result, anyone across the world will always be free to use the network, participate in running Radix nodes, or stake <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-are-the-xrd-and-exrd-tokens\"><strong id=\"\">XRD</strong></a> tokens to support Radix’s <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-kind-of-staking-system-does-radix-use\"><strong id=\"\">Delegated Proof of Stake system</strong></a> to enhance network <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-do-security-safety-and-liveness-mean\"><strong id=\"\">security</strong></a>. This fully permissionless operation and access is key to the Radix network providing a truly <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-do-distributed-and-decentralized-mean\"><strong id=\"\">decentralized</strong></a> platform for finance.<br></p><p id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Further reading:</strong></p><ul id=\"\"><li id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-do-trustless-and-permissionless-mean\"><strong id=\"\">What do “Trustless” and “Permissionless” mean?</strong></a></li><li id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/is-radix-decentralized\"><strong id=\"\">Is Radix decentralized?</strong></a></li></ul>",
